    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        PETAR: Localized Findings Generation with Mask-Aware Vision-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Modeling</span> for PET Automated Reporting
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
