    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Multilingual BERT <span class="search-hit mathjax">language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">model</span> for medical tasks: Evaluation on domain-specific adaptation and cross-linguality
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Luo%2C+Y">Yinghao Luo</a>, 
      
