    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        AMO-Bench: Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> Still Struggle in High School Math Competitions
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=An%2C+S">Shengnan An</a>, 
      
